{"version":1,"content":"<p>西貢康定路發生車內燒炭死亡案件。</p><p>今午（24日）2時許，警方接獲報案，指途經西貢康定後發現一男子於車內疑燒炭昏迷。</p><p>救援人員到場證實在車廂的男子已死亡。</p><p>警方在車廂檢獲炭爐，並發現遺書，案件列自殺，其死因仍有待剖驗確定。</p><p>據悉，事件金錢問題。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-24T10:22:28.131142+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":121,"images":0,"source":"明報 本地","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-24T07:17:33+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-24T11:18:09.012316+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-24T10:18:10.547649+00:00","content_hash":"10067557f7ef6d664e14ef26c30f5471ec37d4cca22317d3067ee04970e738ed","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}